<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">experience</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">experience</ansi> command shows your skill progression. Skills improve
through use -- the more you practice a skill, the more likely it is to
advance in rank.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">experience</ansi>                - See a summary of your skill ranks
  <ansi fg="command">experience skills</ansi>          - See detailed skill use counts
  <ansi fg="command">experience stats</ansi>           - See stat usage counts

